      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we should direct people toward the deprecated go/packages mode values. I\u0027d guess the argument for the new mode API is that the values are easier to remember: just request the fields that you use. If we\u0027re going to recommend the old APIs, we should file a proposal to un-deprecate.\n\nBut as of now, my experience is that the new API is easier to use.",
      "revId": "78f16309513e2ca22da782eb5a66a26516576be4",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705"
    },
    {
